	(text_box "LAYOUT NOTE: ETHERCAT\n* TX/RX pairs 100 ohm differential, matched in-pair, short; 49.9R at the U2 pins.\n* Keep PHY side and cable side of T1/T2 apart; no GND plane under the cable side and the GH connectors except the Bob Smith cap return; C94/C97 right at the centre taps.\n* Y1 + caps and R85 (RBIAS) tight to their pins; exposed pad via array to GND."
